WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00.040 --> 00:03.500
I've reached a point of real frustration with Marino.

2
00:03.560 --> 00:08.620
The first few months we worked together,
our relationship was… well, it was fine.

3
00:08.680 --> 00:11.500
We weren't particularly close, but it's been really busy

4
00:11.560 --> 00:14.940
and we did what we needed to do
to keep this project moving.

5
00:15.000 --> 00:20.540
I haven't had the time or energy to address the fact
that Marino has consistently been missing deadlines.

6
00:20.600 --> 00:24.940
This week, however, we are officially at risk
of not completing this project on time,

7
00:25.000 --> 00:27.580
and our team leader isn't happy with any of us.

8
00:27.640 --> 00:29.020
I don't know what to do.

9
00:29.080 --> 00:31.260
We're in this situation because of Marino,

10
00:31.320 --> 00:35.980
but I'm so annoyed with him,
I don't even know how to start the conversation.
